WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.760
LOOK. Paper litter is scattered in a schoolyard.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.568
ACT. Learners put safe litter into bins.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.525
AFTER. The schoolyard is clear and tidy.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.632
CARE. Everyone follows safe waste rules.
